WEBVTT

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.010
Blue Maiden!

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.890
Thank you, Playmaker.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.180
Be careful.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.780
If you leave the path and enter the 
turbulence, who knows where you'll end up.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.500
There's the exit!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.570
Let's go!

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:25.010
We have three enemies: 
Lightning, Windy and Bohman!

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.650
Let's find them!

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:50.350
Our lives aren't forever

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:57.140
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:04.460
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:11.030
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:17.780
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:25.010
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:31.720
I want to share your pain

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.770
This is Mirror LINK VRAINS.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.750
They're somewhere around here.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.320
I'll let you out here.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:17.560
I don't know what'll happen, 
but you knew the risks.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.900
Go wherever you like.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:23.710
Fly!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:28.520
Is LINK VRAINS okay?

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.760
What's the status of LINK VRAINS?

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:35.100
The whole world is uneasy.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.740
The situation is unpredictable.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.880
It's bugging out!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.930
This is bad!

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.710
Something's happening again?

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:44.750
What is SOL doing?

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.490
Perform maintenance!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.000
You're in charge of here.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.180
What about you?

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:54.160
I'll lead from LINK VRAINS.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:58.940
If something happens over 
there, let me know at once.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.130
Understood.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:01.440
Invaders detected!

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:05.270
We will eliminate you!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.620
They've showed up.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.510
Let's deal with them!

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.520
It's started.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:16.460
I don't want those duelists 
battling in that area.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:21.750
She's nearby.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.220
She used to call herself Blue Angel.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.230
She's now Blue Maiden.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.590
She is Aoi Zaizen.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:37.670
Younger sister of Akira Zaizen, SOL 
Technologies' Security Manager.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.360
They're siblings...

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.560
Stepsiblings.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:44.200
Siblings for convenience sake.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.560
Oh yeah - I set it up for you 
and Bohman to be siblings.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:54.260
Blue Maiden and Aqua, the Water 
Ignis, are fighting together.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.230
Don't underestimate her instincts.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.260
It'd be bad if they find 
Bohman's location right now.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.190
He's currently synchronizing 
with Mirror LINK VRAINS.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.670
We can't let them interfere with that.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.310
BitBoot won't last long.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.800
You go and fight Blue Maiden.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.510
Do you think I can win?

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.790
You don't need to win.

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.080
You just need to buy time.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.360
Okay.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:30.120
He doesn't think I can win.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.980
If I lose, what'll happen to me?

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:37.510
Whatever.  No point thinking about that.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:41.440
I guess I'll go see him first.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.820
What is it, Haru?

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:55.880
Playmaker's team has invaded 
Mirror LINK VRAINS.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:05:00.480
I see.  My task will soon be done.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.860
And they'll have nowhere to run.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.810
You're right.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.670
Didn't you want something?

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.630
No, not really.

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:15.650
I just came to see you.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.170
Lightning must've said something to you.

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.770
How did you know?

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:23.340
Did he tell you to attack?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.970
Well, yeah...

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.070
Don't go.

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.680
What are you talking about?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.310
There's a clear difference in your skills.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.890
You won't be able to defeat them.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.720
We won't know until I try!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:39.950
I'm warning you as your older brother.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.950
We're not brothers.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:46.080
And I was born first!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:52.290
I was ordered to be your younger brother to 
calm you because you're emotionally unstable!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:57.030
Haru, your consciousness is imperfect.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:00.510
So what?  Are you saying I'm inferior?

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.510
No.  You're my younger brother.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:06.490
I won't forget those times.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:09.480
Who cares about those times?

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:11.050
I was always...

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:14.160
Forced to babysit you!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.770
Why are you following me?

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:32.600
Why?  I'm just protecting you.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.840
You don't need to!

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:39.810
It's the older brother's job 
to protect his younger brother.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.810
That's annoying!

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:46.560
There are no other brothers like us.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.820
Stop following me!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.060
Haru?

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.390
I have no great memories.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.160
I'm going.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.590
Wait, Haru!

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:58.770
If you lose in Mirror LINK 
VRAINS, you'll be erased!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.860
I don't care!

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.110
I'm a failed AI anyway.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.200
I'm not afraid of being erased!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:11.180
If it means I'll never have to 
see you again, what a relief!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.500
Haru...

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:18.830
Sheesh!  I shouldn't have seen him!

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:25.130
This is the end!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.100
They're all gone.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:32.970
No, there's more.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:38.340
I'm your next opponent, Blue Maiden!

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:39.880
He's...

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:44.350
According to Playmaker's info, 
he's Bohman's younger brother AI.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:46.510
Bohman's brother?

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:48.960
Let's duel, Blue Maiden!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:54.220
If I defeat him, I may learn 
Bohman and Lightning's location.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.700
Let's do it, Aqua!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.350
Speed Duel!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.250
I go first!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.920
My turn!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:08.580
When there are no monsters, I can 
Special Summon Hydradrive Booster!

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.310
Appear!  My circuit!

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.730
Link Summon!

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:18.730
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.380
That's a Hydradrive monster.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.660
He has the same deck as Bohman.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.470
It's not the same!

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:30.200
Hydradrive was originally my deck!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.700
I taught Bohman how to duel!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.550
Taught Bohman?

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:38.080
I activate the spell 
card, Hydradrive Rebuild!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.380
It destroys a Hydradrive on the field!

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:45.960
The destroyed Coolant 
Hydradrive's effect activates!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:49.470
I Special Summon a Hydradrive Token!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:57.180
Due to Hydradrive Rebuild, I Special Summon a 
Hydradrive from my graveyard by negating its effects!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.190
Resurrect, Coolant Hydradrive!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.980
I activate the spell card, 
Hydradrive Utilization!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:11.310
I pay 500 LP and banish Hydradrive 
Booster from my graveyard.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:14.850
I add the same card from my deck to my hand.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:20.780
I activate my Skill!  Marker's Portal!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:23.980
I activate a Link Spell from my deck!

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.980
The three arrows that judge the world!

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:29.960
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.420
Judgment Arrows?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:37.560
I summon Hydradrive Booster from my hand!

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:40.070
Appear!  My circuit!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.620
Link Summon!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.540
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:49.010
Appear again!  My circuit!

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.740
Link Summon!

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:54.980
Link 1 Flow Hydradrive!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.440
Appear for a third time!  My circuit!

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:02.190
The summoning conditions are 
two Hydradrive Link Monsters!

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.150
Link Summon!

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:07.640
Link 2 Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:15.390
Its Attribute becomes the same Water and 
Wind Attributes as the monsters used to summon it.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:17.930
Twin Hydradrive Knight's effect!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:22.590
If a monster has the same Attribute 
as my Knight, its effects are negated!

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:25.950
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.620
That's not good for us.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:36.490
But you're capable of breaking through.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:41.680
Trust our deck and yourself!

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.460
Right.  Watch, Aqua!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:47.560
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:51.010
I summon Marincess Seahorse from my hand!

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:55.510
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.640
Link Summon!

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:01.940
Link 1 Marincess Blue Slug!

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.540
Marincess?

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:05.450
She has a new deck.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:08.660
But since it's Water, it 
can't use its effects!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:16.880
This Marincess Deck show my 
and Aqua's new potential!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:20.730
I Special Summon Marincess 
Seahorse from my hand!

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:26.910
I can Special Summon Seahorse from my hand 
next to a Marincess Link Monster's link!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:30.380
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:34.040
The summoning conditions 
are two Water monsters!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:38.940
I set Marincess Seahorse and 
Blue Slug in the Link Markers!

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.670
Link Summon!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:46.070
Appear, Link 2 Marincess Coral Anemone!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:53.160
I set one card and activate Marincess 
Seastar's effect from my hand!

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:59.230
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
Coral Anemone gains 800 ATK!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.700
I can't stop an effect if it's from the hand.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.880
Battle!

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:07.440
Coral Anemone attacks Coolant Hydradrive!

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:11.840
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows's effect!

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:17.320
When a linked Link Monster 
battles, its ATK are doubled!

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.560
Go, Coral Anemone!

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:32.630
Since Coolant Hydradrive was destroyed, 
I Special Summon a Hydradrive Token!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.220
I end my turn.

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:36.960
This is going well.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.840
Keep it up!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:42.820
I can't lose for Miyu or my brother.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.320
Your brother.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:51.330
I know that you two aren't 
connected by blood.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.410
But you call yourself siblings?

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:57.990
Humans are silly.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:01.460
Aren't you and Bohman siblings?

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.310
No, we're not.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.430
Will my brother wake up?

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.140
Don't worry.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:16.870
But this Bohman won't need to 
have his emotions controlled.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:20.730
From now on, you'll be his servant.

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:23.480
Not his younger brother?

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.760
"Brothers" are just a designation.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:32.640
Lightning used brotherhood to control Bohman.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:35.560
Then you can't understand.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:39.110
Me and my brother are not united by blood.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:44.660
But we've made memories together.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:49.120
Those memories aren't a designation!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:52.510
Our hearts are strongly united!

00:13:57.460 --> 00:14:02.610
No matter what you say, siblings are lame!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.670
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:08.540
Appear!  My circuit!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.840
Link Summon!

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:13.630
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:18.500
I activate the Equip Spell, 
Hydradrive Impact from my hand!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.080
I equip it on Coolant Hydradrive!

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:28.390
When you have a monster, the equipped monster 
can attack you directly and deal double damage!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:32.860
But the equipped monster must attack.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.020
A card that doubles damage!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.450
That's right.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:39.550
With this direct attack, 
a single strike ends you.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:42.050
This is my special combo!

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:46.230
Battle!  Coolant Hydradrive 
attacks you directly!

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:48.700
I win!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.600
I won't let you!

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:54.570
I activate the trap, Marincess Wave!

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:57.950
Your monster's effects are negated!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.150
What?

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:03.650
Now Coolant Hydradrive 
can't attack me directly.

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:08.860
And due to Hydradrive Impact, 
you can't stop your attack!

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.940
Coolant Hydradrive attacks Coral Anemone!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:19.830
Due to Judgment Arrows, Coolant 
Hydradrive's ATK are doubled!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:25.600
Hydradrive Impact's effect only 
activates during a direct attack.

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:29.580
It has less ATK than Coral Anemone!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.180
The destroyed Coolant Hydradrive's effect!

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:41.910
I Special Summon a Hydradrive 
Token on the field!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.300
I can't afford to lose!

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:49.040
Twin Hydradrive Knight attacks Coral Anemone!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:55.160
Due to Judgment Arrows, its ATK are doubled!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:03.020
Coral Anemone's effect activates!

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:07.540
When it's sent to the graveyard, I add 
a Marincess in the graveyard to my hand!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:12.230
I return Marincess Wave!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.960
The trap card you just used...

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:20.020
I activate the trap card, 
Hydradrive Nightmare!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.870
Due to its effect, I tribute 
a Hydradrive Token.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:27.750
Resurrect, Coolant Hydradrive!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:32.940
But that monster is destroyed 
at the end of this turn.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:36.410
Coolant Hydradrive attacks you directly!

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:39.150
And Judgment Arrows's effect!

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:50.360
I'll use this attack to my advantage!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:55.330
Free the emotions sleeping 
within you, Blue Maiden!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.100
I activate my Skill!

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:59.310
Shape of Sea!

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:06.970
A Skill?

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.340
When I take battle damage...

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:15.380
...I Special Summon a Water monster from my 
graveyard with equal or less ATK than the damage!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.430
Resurrect, Marincess Coral Anemone!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.340
I end my turn.

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:30.150
Coolant Hydradrive is destroyed, and 
I Special Summon a Hydradrive Token.

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:34.710
I have something precious 
that I need to protect.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:37.880
Since you don't, I can't 
afford to lose against you!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:41.950
Something to protect?  Such nonsense-

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.810
Why did I suddenly think of him?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.150
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.890
I summon Marincess Seahorse!

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:57.360
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:01.410
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Water monsters!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.650
Link Summon!

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:09.180
Awaken, Link 3 Marincess Marbled Rock!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:13.470
Coral Anemone's effect activates!

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:18.480
When it's sent to the graveyard, I add 
Seastar from my graveyard to my hand!

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:22.480
I activate the trap card, 
Marincess Wave from my hand!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:28.320
When there's a Link 3 or higher Marincess,  
I can activate this card from my hand!

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:32.720
I negate Twin Hydradrive Knight's effects!

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:39.360
Now I can use the effects of Water monsters.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:42.370
And Marincess Wave's effect!

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:49.010
When there's a Link 2 or higher Marincess, 
your effects can't affect Marbled Rock this turn!

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:55.010
But Twin Hydradrive 
Knight's ATK rise to 3600.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.980
Your monster can't destroy it!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:05.300
Wrong.  I send Seastar from my hand to the 
graveyard to raise a monster's ATK by 800!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.820
Marbled Rock's effect activates!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:12.730
I add a Marincess from 
my graveyard to my hand.

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:15.710
I add Seastar!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:21.810
Due to Seastar's effect, Marbled 
Rock gains 800 more ATK!

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:24.900
4100 ATK?

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:25.910
Battle!

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:29.990
Marbled Rock attacks Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.550
Judgment Arrows's effect!

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:39.010
Marincess Submerge!

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.120
It's not over!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.400
I still have LP-

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:54.010
Wrong!  It's already over!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.510
What do you mean?

00:19:56.510 --> 00:20:01.260
I activate the trap card, 
Marincess Current from my hand!

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:10.180
I can activate it from my hand when a Link 
3 or higher Marincess destroys your monster.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:15.170
This card deals 400 damage 
for each Link Marker.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:20.130
The Marbled Rock that destroyed 
Hydradrive Knight has 3 Link Markers!

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:23.130
And when there's a Link 
2 or higher Marincess...

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:29.140
...you take 500 damage for each Link 
Marker that your destroyed monster had.

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:34.460
So you take a total of 2200 damage!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.060
What?

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:49.990
You waked up.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.150
Haru...

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.970
What's wrong?

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:56.060
Why are you crying?

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.340
Huh?

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.910
Why?

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.470
It's beautiful.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:06.990
You think?

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:11.740
AIs will eventually reach eternal prosperity.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:14.580
We'll be together forever.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.320
I see.  That's the bond between brothers.

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:21.860
Those were my most precious moments.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:24.820
It wasn't just a designation.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:30.940
But now you won't have to 
see my worthless face again.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:33.030
Brother...

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:36.150
Sorry.  Goodbye.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:46.560
Mirroring system synchronization complete.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:55.890
Haru, I'll never forget you.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:59.380
We truly were brothers.

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:03.150
We're together forever.

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:23.930
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:25.370
Even denials are obvious

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:26.500
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.340
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:30.000
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.570
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:32.740
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:39.780
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:42.850
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:45.990
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:49.060
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:57.630
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:03.770
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:04.170 --> 00:23:09.180
If we're together

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:12.580
We can seize it

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:42.230
Judgment Arrows is the core of 
Lightning's Armatos Legio Deck.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:45.840
That's Spectre's analysis of his enemy.

00:23:45.840 --> 00:23:53.210
He also wants a card as 
spectacular as that one.

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:56.950
He has another strategy 
against Judgment Arrows!

00:23:56.950 --> 00:24:01.280
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Wisdom of the Deprived

